  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。滿滿愛心製作。大量活躍模組支援 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《彈跳床》是一個讓床變得更有趣且實用的模組。使用此模組，預設情況下您可以彈跳高達 20 格。但您可以在設定檔中調整這個數值。與朋友一起彈跳，或在高高在上、只有靠彈跳床才能到達的隱藏房間裡玩耍。盡情享受吧！<br><br>摔落傷害預設在床塊上取消。這讓您可以盡情彈跳到任何高度，不必擔心……只要您再次落在床上。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's Extra Bundle\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>bedsPreventFallDamage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">設定床是否在玩家落在上面時防止摔落傷害。如果您設定很高的彈跳力，建議保持啟用。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>bedBounciness</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 1.5，最小值 0.0，最大值 100.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">控制床的彈跳力倍率。數值 2.0 會讓玩家跳躍約 30 格。數值 100.0 則會讓玩家跳躍約 4500 格。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>彈彈彈！</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bouncier-beds/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"558\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>更彈！</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bouncier-beds/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有模組的概覽及更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">評論功能已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多獨立模組頁面中追蹤留言。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或任何其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
